====Future====
The future is formed with the suffix ''-(i)ssa-'' + the primary endings<ref>Perniola (1997: 87)</ref>, although the ''-ss-'' may be reduced to a single ''-s-'' or further lenited to ''-h-''.<ref>Oberlies (2001: 245)</ref> Again, verbs in ''-e-'' may or may not replace it with ''-aya-''.<ref>Perniola (1997: 88)</ref> Vowels other than ''-e-'' are dropped and replaced by ''-i-''; e.g. ''suṇāti'' "to hear" - ''suṇissati'' "he will hear".<ref>Collins (2003: 90)</ref> 
